  "name": "AI Receipt Scanner (Telegram to Google Sheets)",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "d8ff6405-e252-41be-aace-f938244b5480",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -160,
        -224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#D7C8EA",
        "width": 336,
        "height": 368,
        "content": "## \ud83d\udce9 Receive Receipt Photo\n\n### Purpose\nTriggers the workflow when a user sends a receipt image or document through Telegram.\n\n### How It Works\n- Listens for incoming Telegram messages.\n- Downloads the attached receipt as binary data.\n\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6f661f53-706f-4262-bb6d-22c0563cc029",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        192,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#C8DDEA",
        "width": 352,
        "height": 464,
        "content": "## \ud83d\udd17 Create Public Image Link\n\n### Purpose\nUploads the receipt image and generates a Permanent public URL.\n\n### How It Works\n- Receives the downloaded image from Telegram.\n- Uploads the image using UploadToURL.\n- Returns a URL that the AI node can access.\n\n### Why It's Needed\nProvides an accessible image URL for AI-powered receipt analysis.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2b6334a6-ab21-4b2a-9fab-2aeaa49a5c01",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        560,
        -368
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#EAD7C8",
        "width": 304,
        "height": 512,
        "content": "## \ud83e\udd16 AI: Extract Receipt Data\n\n### Purpose\nUses OpenAI GPT-4.1 mini to read the receipt and extract key information.\n\n### How It Works\n- Analyzes the image using the  public URL.\n- Extracts the vendor name, receipt date, total amount, and tax.\n\n### Why It's Needed\nAutomates receipt data extraction and eliminates most manual expense entry.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "db5d891f-d6aa-41cc-86c1-c1ea321e5731",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        880,
        -400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#E0DBBE",
        "width": 336,
        "height": 544,
        "content": "## \ud83d\udcca Save to Expense Sheet\n\n### Purpose\nStores the extracted receipt details in Google Sheets.\n\n### How It Works\n- Parses the JSON response returned by the AI node.\n- Maps the extracted values to the corresponding spreadsheet columns.\n- Appends a new row containing Vendor, Date, Tax, and Total Amount.\n\n### Why It's Needed\nCreates a centralized expense record that can be used for tracking spending, reviewing receipts, and preparing expense reports.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7aff706a-823c-4ac3-a2e4-ec24a60b66e7",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -160,
        -544
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#EAC7DD",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 208,
        "content": "## \ud83e\uddfe AI Receipt Scanner - Workflow Overview\n\n### This workflow captures receipt images sent through Telegram and downloads them automatically.\n### It uploads each image to generate a Permanent public URL for AI processing.\n### OpenAI analyzes the receipt and extracts the vendor, date, total amount, and tax.\n### The extracted information is returned as structured JSON for easy processing.\n### Google Sheets maps the extracted values into the appropriate columns and appends a new row.\n### This automates expense recording while reducing manual data entry and keeping receipt information organized."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
